#. module: webship
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:webship.field_res_config_settings__webship_last_check_status_update
msgid ""
"Checkpoint of the incremental status-update queue. Only orders and purchase "
"orders edited in Stoqflow after this timestamp are fetched (edited_after). "
"Advanced to the newest 'edited' timestamp seen after each successful poll. "
"Editable so you can re-run the fetch over a wider window."
msgstr ""
