msgid ""
"Transfer %(name)s is managed by the Stoqflow sync (process code: %(code)s). It will be validated automatically when Stoqflow completes the order; validating it manually now would make Odoo and Stoqflow diverge.\n"
"\n"
"If you really need to complete it in Odoo, set its Stoqflow process code to 'Manual' first (Stoqflow tab on the transfer)."
msgstr ""
"Overboeking %(name)s wordt beheerd door de Stoqflow-synchronisatie (processcode: %(code)s). Ze wordt automatisch gevalideerd wanneer Stoqflow de order voltooit; ze nu manueel valideren zou Odoo en Stoqflow doen uiteenlopen.\n"
"\n"
"Moet je ze echt in Odoo afsluiten, zet dan eerst haar Stoqflow-processcode op 'Manueel' (tabblad Stoqflow op de overboeking)."

#. module: webship
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:webship.res_config_settings_view_form
